<title>USA: Coca-Cola, Circle K Stores end lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola, Circle K Stores end lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Co and Circle K Stores Inc said Friday they had ended their lawsuit and entered into a new multi-year agreement.</p>
<p>The agreement ensures that Coca-Cola soft drink brands will continue to be available in Circle K, a subsidiary of Circle K Corp, the companies said.</p>
<p>Terms of the new accord was not disclosed.</p>
</text>
